{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hancui-e-16bf3745dffef9cce12a","title":"鲁相傅祗崔林议孔子祀礼","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-16bf3745dffef9cce12a","label":"正文","text":"鲁相傅祗崔林议孔子祀礼","evidence":["hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hancui-p-2a222e2be0f0e9","role":"上言请祭","evidence":["hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"]},{"person":"hancui-p-e10ac3b3d9c070","role":"议礼","evidence":["hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0053","role":"议礼","evidence":["hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","related_events":[{"event":"hancui-e-a4b89257fe4653b74cc6","type":"disputes","evidence":["hancui-q-f3e0a53500861d874806","hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"]}],"order":4925}],"persons":[{"id":"hancui-p-2a222e2be0f0e9","name":"鲁相（请祀孔子者）","evidence":["hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-a90cd01de48db37c2020","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-a95417fd50b34fdb3de2","layer":"original","quote":"林议以为：“宗圣侯亦以王命祀，不为未有命也。周武王封黄帝、尧、舜之后〖13〗，及立三恪〖14〗；禹、汤之世〖15〗，不列于时，复特命他官祭也。今周公以上〖16〗，达于三皇〖17〗，忽焉不祀，而其礼经亦存其言〖18〗；今独祀孔子者，以世近故也。以大夫之后〖19〗，特受无疆之祀〖20〗；礼过古帝，义逾汤、武。可谓崇明报德矣，无复重祀于非族也〖21〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-b3c58a342c48a9187281","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-f9faf0e3543fd84c0775","layer":"original","quote":"鲁相上言：“汉旧立孔子庙〖1〗，褒成侯岁时奉祠〖2〗；辟雍行礼〖3〗，必祭先师；王家出谷〖4〗，春秋祭祀。今宗圣侯奉嗣〖5〗，未有命祭之礼〖6〗；宜给牲牢〖7〗，长吏奉祀，尊为贵神。”制三府议。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-d29bae2c4129fbdf68c8","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-b5dbe24a58e2150a9108","layer":"original","quote":"博士傅祗以“《春秋》传言立在祀典〖8〗，则孔子是也。宗圣适足继绝世〖9〗，彰盛德耳〖10〗；至于显立言〖11〗，崇明德〖12〗，则宜如鲁相所上。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-f3e0a53500861d874806","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-2d2985d7613a788051e9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：孟轲称宰我之辞曰：“以予观夫子，贤于尧舜远矣！”又曰：“生民以来，未有盛于孔子者也。”斯非通贤之格言，商较之定准乎！虽妙极则同，万圣犹一；然淳薄异时，质文殊用；或当时则荣，没则已焉；是以遗风所被，实有深浅。若乃经纬天人，立言垂制；百王莫之能违，彝伦资之以立：诚一人而已耳！周监二代，斯文为盛。然于六经之道，未能及其精致。加以圣贤不兴，旷年五百，道化陵夷，宪章殆灭；若使时无孔门，则周典几乎息矣。夫能光明先王之道，以成万世之功；齐天地之无穷，等日月之久照：岂不有逾于群圣哉？林，曾无史迁洞想之诚，梅真慷慨之志，而守其蓬心以塞明义，可谓多见其不知量也。","attribution":"裴注·裴松之评论","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6ef6eb809e465ce950a4","start":0,"end":283,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
